## 5. SQL de ejemplo - Consultar plantillas de un test

```sql
SELECT ct.*
FROM "CompoundTemplates" ct
INNER JOIN "TestCompoundTemplates" tct ON tct.tct_template_id = ct.ct_id
WHERE tct.tct_test_id = 5        -- ID del test
  AND ct.ct_active = TRUE
ORDER BY tct.tct_order_index ASC;
```

